### Admin Login to get token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Upload MD Document
POST http://localhost:5000/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"

2026.1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="effectiveDate"

2026-01-01
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

General
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="region"

GLOBAL
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test MD Doc
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Test
This is a test MD doc.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload JSON Document
POST http://localhost:5000/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
